  "summary": "As a Senior Website Developer, I design, code and modify websites, from layout to function, according to a client's specifications. Using a range of creative and technical skills, I build websites that are visually attractive and technically sound that feature user-friendly design and are easy to navigate on all internet connected devices at any screen size with optimized content for search visibility to attract targeted traffic.\n\nWeb Development for Successful Business Websites:\nResponsive Web Design, Mobile Websites, Website Redesign, Wordpress Customizations and Training\n\nOngoing Support for Connecticut Businesses:\nWebsite Updates and Content Management Systems\nWebsite Search Optimization & Analytics\nSocial Media Set-up and Training\n\nGraphic Art and Design for Print and Web:\nResponsive slideshows\nCustom logos and branding\nPhoto optimization\nArtwork for ads & promotional items\n\nAs a Certified Webmaster, I provide quality web services & support including website updates and online marketing for established websites of progressive companies and organizations.  I maintain long-term business relationships with valued Connecticut businesses by following current design trends & through ongoing professional development in advanced technology. \n\nRead more about my responsibilities and qualifications as a Senior Web Designer in the Experience Section.",
